1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,992
I stole a stranger's childhood joy just to avoid a late fee this morning.

2
00:00:05,292 --> 00:00:13,308
It sounds insane, but my white lies have a literal weight. Whenever I deceive, someone somewhere forgets happiness.

3
00:00:13,608 --> 00:00:20,592
Yesterday, I told my boss traffic was terrible. Across town, a little girl forgot her first puppy.

4
00:00:20,892 --> 00:00:28,740
I watched the tally update on my phone. One small fib equals one deleted golden moment of human peace.

5
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:37,488
So I stopped lying entirely. For three days, brutal, unfiltered truth was my only language with the world.

6
00:00:37,788 --> 00:00:46,668
The ledger stayed at zero. No stolen smiles. No hijacked memories. I was finally healing the invisible damage.

7
00:00:46,968 --> 00:00:53,184
Then a terrified stranger pulled me from the path of a speeding car, asking if I was okay.

8
00:00:53,484 --> 00:01:00,924
To save his feelings, and my own pride, I forced a tight smile and lied. I said I was fine.

9
00:01:01,224 --> 00:01:08,760
My phone buzzed instantly. The ledger flashed red. Ten thousand points deducted all at once.

10
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:16,932
The man who saved me suddenly wept, looking at me blankly, whispering that he had just forgotten his own name.
